      "statement": "Ecolab's 8-K describes CoolIT as a pure-play data-center liquid-cooling company that designs and manufactures CDUs, cold plates and direct-to-chip cooling, serving hyperscale and colocation operators, with liquid cooling framed as needed for advanced AI workloads. Acquirer's description of its target (not independent of the deal); no substitutability or sole-source claim.",
      "disproof_condition": "條件：Ecolab 後續 10-Q／10-K 揭露 CoolIT 的 CDU 或冷板業務出售、停產，或 AI 資料中心液冷營收占比大降。核查頻率：每季（Ecolab 10-Q／10-K）。觸發後 48 小時：e1、e2 降 confidence，重讀冷板與 CDU 兩層。"
    },
